{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はのぎ天2生放送の前に\n学校と美容院行ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容院ではカラーとトリートメントしてもらって髪の毛とぅるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルーを入れてください！ってお願いしたら\n私の理想の色になって感激( ;o; )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとこの色にしたかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルーアッシュは、暗めの色だけど\nどこか透明感があって、外国人風な髪色になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外国人風な色にしたかったからよかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまたすぐ色落ちしちゃうと思うから\nまた美容院行って髪の毛とぅるんしてもらわなきゃ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とぅるん！\nとぅるんとぅるん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、とぅるんって可愛い。\nとぅるん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天2が今日から生放送されました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は1回目と2回目に分けて、\nそれぞれメンバーを替えての放送だったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回目のメンバーは、\n私、愛未、川後、まあや、かりん、純奈！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天2は、ラジオ形式のような感じで\n皆さんからのお便りや、\nメンバーの裏エピソードや、\n私たちの普段の様子などが\n見られるラフな番組になっております！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は静岡のライブについてや、\n46時間テレビの裏側、\nメンバーへの質問等々。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問の中に46時間テレビの人狼の時に\nちーちゃんが言ってたの「セクシーダイナマイト」ってなんですか？？\nというのがきていました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃそうだよね。\n気になるよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれは、人狼中に追放されてモニタールームに移動した時に\nメンバーの様子を見ていた時に\nさゆの胸元がセクシーなのに気付いて、\nさゆがモニタールームに入ってきたときに\n「さゆ！胸元がすごいセクシーダイナマイト」って言ったら、セクシーダイナマイトから放送されてしまっていた。ということです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しは謎が解けたかな...？\nすっきりしたかな...？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セクシーダイナマイト。\n皆さんも使ってね(｡･o･｡)ﾉ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの裏側写真の中の1枚♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルーチーム(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンク、紫、ブルーの3色だったんだけど\n仲良しちゃん達がみんなブルーでした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天2は私服なんだけど\n(今後どうなるか分からないけど...恐らくこれからも)\n今日もチョーカーしたよ〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リボン結び。猫ちゃんスタイル。\n見えづらいかな！？( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後もまあやもチョーカーしてて可愛かった。\n似合ってた。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに飲んでるのは、\nリンツのストロベリードリンク。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほどよい甘さと酸味と、\nチョコとのコントラストが\n絶妙で美味しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、これからものぎ天2の活動を\n楽しみにしていてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/17/7176732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はアルバム個別握手会ですね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだな(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに着ようかな〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりあれかな。\nきーめたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日握手会会場行っても、\nまいまいはいないんだよね。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいな。、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいロス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}